Subject: Re: Estimation CFA of Categorical Data without "DWLS"
Message-ID: <EnzxnaHKjFc.gOr2uk1nBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <EnzxnaHKjFc.Gva9HUh8BAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <EnzxnaHKjFc.Gva9HUh8BAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
