Jess

This doesnt seem like something to be better done in lavaan, and dont see that as a latent variable, if I understand is a regression beta that varies over time.

For something like this I would recommend you to look at the R package brms, very flexible to do bayesian regressions with similar syntax to R, uses Stan as the bayesia engine

